<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>AWS Data Dashboard</title>
<style>
body { background:#0a1220; color:#fff; font-family:Arial; }
.header { text-align:center; padding:20px; color:#4dd0e1; }
.cards { display:flex; justify-content:space-around; margin:20px; }
.card { background:#112233; padding:20px; border-radius:10px; width:30%; text-align:center; border:1px solid #4dd0e1; }
.chart { background:#112233; margin:20px; padding:20px; border-radius:10px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>AWS DATA — SECURE | SCALABLE | REAL-TIME</h1>
    <p>Data-Driven Solutions Powered by AWS</p>
  </div>

  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">Active Pipelines<br><b>24 +12%</b></div>
    <div class="card">Data Ingested<br><b>1.4PB +8%</b></div>
    <div class="card">Avg Latency<br><b>45ms -5%</b></div>
  </div>

  <div class="chart">
    <h3>Monthly Data Processing (TB)</h3>
    <p>[Yahan aapka Bar Chart ayega]</p>
  </div>

  <div class="chart">
    <h3>Growth Trend 2024 → 2025</h3>
    <p>[Yahan aapka Line Graph ayega]</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
